  "description": "Stronger than most, Gyeong-Ja Yuk is back! After a tough day, Kyung-Ja, having broken up with her lover and repeatedly failing at finding a job, receives a job offer from a major corporation called \"The Shield.\" With no academic background or connections, Gyeong-Ja is skeptical, but dreams of a warm and comfortable office job, so she goes for an interview... \n\nbut the company, its employees, and the interviewees are all unusual?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
